      "problem": "Calculate ${\\int }_{0}^{1}[f(t)+2g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t$ given that ${\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-3,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡1,\\,-1⟩$ and ${\\int }_{0}^{1}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨5,\\,1,\\,-2⟩.$",
